        "thought_text": "Calculate the difference $d = |a - b|$. Find the smallest $k$ where $k(k+1)/2 eq d$. If the sum equals $d$, return $k$. If the sum exceeds $d$, check if the difference between sum and $d$ is even; if so, return $k$, otherwise return $k+1$.",
        "parent_revision_path_hash": "-1684219730338685187",
