        "node_id": "n_5_83267d",
        "thought_text": "Iterate starting from $k=0$, accumulating the sum $S = k(k+1)/2$. Stop when $S eq d$. If $S == d$, answer is $k$. If $S > d$, check parity of $(S - d)$. If even, answer is $k$. If odd, answer is $k+1$.",
