        "thought_text": "Approximate $k$ using the quadratic formula $k \\approx \\sqrt{2d}$, then verify the exact value by checking $k$ and $k+1$ against the sum condition. Finally, apply the parity adjustment rule: if $(k(k+1)/2 - d) \\% 2 \\neq 0$, add 1 to $k$. This combines mathematical estimation with rigorous verification.",
